<section class="analytics-card"><h2>Send-time insights</h2><p><?= $h($timing['ready']?'Strongest observed click hour: '.sprintf('%02d:00 UTC',$timing['best_hour']).'.':'Not enough observed click history; use your selected send time.') ?></p><p class="analytics-explanation"><?= number_format($timing['contacts']) ?> distinct recipients with non-bot click observations in the last 90 days. Scheduling uses at least 100 distinct recipients, across this audience, regardless of the report filters. It never schedules or sends from this page. UTC is an observed event hour, not the recipient’s local time.</p>
<div class="analytics-table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Observed click hour (UTC)</th><th>Distinct recipients</th><th>Distinct messages</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($timing['hours']as$r): ?><tr><th scope="row"><?= sprintf('%02d:00',(int)$r['hour']) ?></th><td><?= number_format((int)$r['contacts']) ?></td><td><?= number_format((int)$r['messages']) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?><?php if(!$timing['hours']): ?><tr><td colspan="3">No qualifying click history.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div><p class="analytics-explanation">Repeated clicks from the same recipient in an hour count once. Open times are not used because privacy proxies can produce opens. Content recommendations based on these observations are descriptive; AI writing assistance belongs to Stage 8.</p></section>
